    "description": "Title\n: Shire Pipes Churchwarden Tobacco Pipe Lilda Classica Long Stem 16 Inches Wood\nBrand\n: Shire Pipes\nModel\n: Lilles Classica\nColor\n: Brown\nDepartment\n: Collectibles > Tobacciana\nCategory\n: Collectibles & Art\nType\n: Shire Pipes Long Stem Churchwarden Tobacco Smoking Pipe\nCondition\n: Good - shows some sign of wear\nApproximate measurements (inches)\n: 16L x 3W x 2H\nWeight (approximate)\n: 0.2 lbs\nDescription\n: Elevate your pipe collection with this Shire Pipes Lilles Classica Churchwarden Tobacco Pipe, featuring a sleek and stylish long stem. The pipe showcases a rich brown finish with a carved design on the bowl for added character. Its extra-long stem, approximately 16 inches, adds a touch of classic sophistication and is ideal for a cooler and smoother smoking experience. Crafted with attention to detail, this pipe features a banded metal accent that complements the overall elegant aesthetic. The bowl is generously sized for a comfortable smoke and the polished exterior highlights the natural wood grain. Perfect for collectors or everyday use, the Churchwarden style makes it easy to handle while keeping smoke away from the face. This pipe is in clean, presentable condition with minimal visible wear, making it a distinguished addition to any tobacciana collection or for personal enjoyment. Please review the photos for detail and ensure this beautifully crafted pipe meets your requirements before purchasing\nShire Pipes Long Stem Churchwarden Tobacco Smoking Pipe",
